                            <comment id="16367295" author="agoncharuk" created="Fri, 16 Feb 2018 13:28:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=pvinokurov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;pvinokurov&quot;&gt;pvinokurov&lt;/a&gt; I am not sure the fix is correct. How can we make sure that internals of a non-null CacheAdapter will not be destroyed after we obtained a non-null reference to it?&lt;/p&gt;

