                            <comment id="16369290" author="jokser" created="Mon, 19 Feb 2018 16:27:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=agoncharuk&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;agoncharuk&quot;&gt;agoncharuk&lt;/a&gt; This issue is not fixed in &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-6113&quot; title=&quot;Partition eviction prevents exchange from completion&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-6113&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-6113&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;. There is no defense against possible NullPointers in partition eviction process.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
